        "You’ve beaten all seven Trainers!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0096_D31R0201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "You’ve beaten the Tower Tycoon!\r",
        "We present you with these Battle\n",
        "Points in recognition of your talent!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} BP!\r"
