    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0096_D31R0201_00076",
      "en_US": [
        "Me?\r",
        "I just made a debut as an Idol!\f",
        "I haven’t gotten much work yet.\r",
        "So whenever I have time, I come here\n",
        "to battle Pokémon."
